                "text": "Passwords are hashed with bcrypt\nSessions use JWT tokens stored in browser localStorage\nThe API has two roles: user and admin\nThere is no rate limiting implemented yet\nThe admin panel is on the same API server, just a different route (/admin/*)\nLogs exist but are stored in the same database (not a separate system)\nThe app does not currently enforce HTTPS redirects"
